## Deploying Code Updates

```bash
# Copy updated file through production jump host
scp -o ProxyJump=root@68.183.168.75 backend/app/services/security/<file>.py root@10.13.13.4:/opt/sandbox/<file>.py

# Restart the service
ssh root@68.183.168.75 "ssh root@10.13.13.4 systemctl restart sandbox-api"
```

